<description>&lt;p&gt;Aung San Suu Kyi spoke with her son for the first time in over five years, and he reported hearing her voice and that she sounded fairly healthy. The conversation was accompanied by books and letters from King Charles III, which Myanmar authorities noted. Military commander Min Aung Hlaing met Japan envoy Sasakawa, showing diplomatic engagement despite ongoing fighting. At least two people were killed in a blast in the Rakhine state capital. The conflict still caused 2,332 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMigwFBVV95cUxQazlnbmRtMzdIN0gtdnVMZ0g5QlIxTFJZMU9zMk50UlV3QVp2eVFBLWJUUGhIQnQ1T21CWEZVV2dyN09BOF8yREt3RThUTjZzV0xObEtaMDJVZXNmV0ZRTGlKRmk4SldyNnNLaTAtS3VmY3c4TGhEcUQxVEZ5bGxPMmFDZw?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Washington Post&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMijAFBVV95cUxNaDQ3bFMyVWV0aHB5RXdQMVpuOWVMZzVWS3BBZTRHU196Wk95SHQwMTBrRkhoVzgzT2RlNUJWVnVPYWgwNm5MZy1adE1aQ3ZCSHJXb1BpcHVBOXhRZVVJWUpJYzBLOEc3clctNVo5MFpBUld4amFobWVISGhvaGthZE1SVndDOXl6aDlJaA?oc=5&quot;&gt;NPR&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiY0FVX3lxTFA4eFFtbFV4MUhtcS1TWld0bGdkWFlKY2pZU3U2cUgyTENPNFg2QnFHVUE1YW5FQi1WWW02RUY5WmNBejF0ZXl4dXJMaWw5aU9ZUzBEcHJHTTZ3VVdjcXpqSjYzZ9IBY0FVX3lxTFA4eFFtbFV4MUhtcS1TWld0bGdkWFlKY2pZU3U2cUgyTENPNFg2QnFHVUE1YW5FQi1WWW02RUY5WmNBejF0ZXl4dXJMaWw5aU9ZUzBEcHJHTTZ3VVdjcXpqSjYzZw?oc=5&quot;&gt;BBC&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Hindu&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiugFBVV95cUxPTG9VN0VTWFlWWXk3c0JiRW5VVzRTUmVRUUtxb04ySFBsVlo3Zk5xYUZ2TFA4MU82dFlyNE9qZTh3WUo3MnZFby1qcW9jc2dWNGhxOUliTFpCa28zQmV3ckhBVUZpTDk3aFlLTHA0bGNGRzQxS251NmdmcmFSMGFOa3YzY29nUWpsUWUyVGNqQ2QzSVZPYXc1WEgzY2VyS0o4WGhWNmJ2VGZnR3ViMWRXUEg0VmM5aUZoR1E?oc=5&quo